        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Open the **World coordinator**, **Fleet and hosts**, **Identity and edge**, **Databases and backups**, or **Kubernetes and releases** dashboard from the header.\n\nExisting focused views: [Traefik](/d/traefik/traefik) and [Garage S3](/d/garage-s3/garage-s3-buckets).\n\n**Instrumentation gaps:** occupied-land moves, end-to-end login results/latency, exact Keycloak Micrometer series, CNPG engine/query/connection/WAL metrics, and historical release events. The dashboards do not infer these from logs, readiness, or counters with different semantics."
